{"id":"4e4fcc9b2d511fa9","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MSat.md","title":"MSat","display":"MSat","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"MSat","parameters":["e","w","r","v","x","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"MSat"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>e</span><span>w</span><span>r</span><span>v</span><span>x</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：正规模态。有序参数：<code>e</code>、<code>w</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>v</code>、<code>x</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ MSat e w r v x a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and (@ MFrame e w r) (and (in x w) (and (@ FmM a) (exists s (and (@ MTable w r v s) (@ Edge s a x))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abaf67a121eca170\" href=\"?note=abaf67a121eca170\" title=\"ZFC_Edge\">Edge</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"852442b30ad8fc4e\" href=\"?note=852442b30ad8fc4e\" title=\"ZFC_FmM\">FmM</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c535786457e5cab\" href=\"?note=6c535786457e5cab\" title=\"ZFC_MFrame\">MFrame</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dfc399e1f596d128\" href=\"?note=dfc399e1f596d128\" title=\"ZFC_MTable\">MTable</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ MSat e w r v x a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Edge","status":"resolved","id":"abaf67a121eca170","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_MFrame|MFrame]]；[[ZFC_MTable|MTable]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmM","status":"resolved","id":"852442b30ad8fc4e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_MFrame|MFrame]]；[[ZFC_MTable|MTable]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_MFrame","status":"resolved","id":"6c535786457e5cab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_MFrame|MFrame]]；[[ZFC_MTable|MTable]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_MTable","status":"resolved","id":"dfc399e1f596d128","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_MFrame|MFrame]]；[[ZFC_MTable|MTable]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":894,"backlinks":[{"id":"b0eb5443b164e777","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MSat|MSat]]"},{"id":"f9a14cb1ffb0e555","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_FormsM|FormsM]]；[[ZFC_MFlags|MFlags]]；[[ZFC_MFrame|MFrame]]；[[ZFC_MSat|MSat]]；[[ZFC_WorldVal|WorldVal]]"},{